Copyright (c) 2025 Google LLC

The icon glyphs in this directory are Google's Material Symbols, in the
"Outlined" style, fetched from

    https://github.com/google/material-design-icons

and renamed to adbshare's own semantic names by tools/fetch_icons.py. The
mapping from each semantic name to the upstream symbol it was fetched from
lives in that script.

